<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><atom:link href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/rss/feed.rss" type="application/rss+xml" rel="self"/><title>Amazon News</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link><description>Amazon News RSS Feed</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:52:52 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Amazon News</title><url>https://assets.aboutamazon.com/f2/a4/a07ef04d49df8b93eb283512a0fc/amazon-news-newsletter-beige.png</url><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link></image><item><title>Amazon data center communities: Here’s what’s happening near data centers across the US</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest updates on how Amazon supports small businesses, creates jobs, sets up sustainability initiatives, and develops educational programs near AWS data centers.</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:12:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/6081627/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2962x2962+1155+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fa3%2Ff6%2F0abb1c1a4734ba2e727893e6eae2%2Faws-data-center-exterior-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon will share its Q3 2026 earnings on October 29</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-earnings-q3-2026-report?utm_source=rss</link><description>On October 29, Amazon is set to hold a conference call to discuss its Q3 2026 financial results.</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:14:12 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-earnings-q3-2026-report</guid><category>Company news</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/afd1609/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F47%2F6d%2F7fe296e642859c7ba2a629eda3ba%2Famazon-logo-hero-images-2024.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon introduces 2 new AI products from Bee: Bee Frontier and Bee Eclipse</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/amazon-personal-ai-bee-frontier-bee-eclipse?utm_source=rss</link><description>Bee expands its ambient AI family with two personal AI devices designed to remember the moments that matter most, plus new integrations with Alexa+ and Amazon.com.</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:55:24 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/amazon-personal-ai-bee-frontier-bee-eclipse</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/eafbdcc/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F20%2F14%2F9d6951844795a24f71e544c24dce%2Fbee-frontier-eclipse-hero-amazonnews-ck101426.jpg"/></item><item><title>Watch the trailer for ‘The Greatest,’ the Muhammad Ali series coming to Prime Video November 4</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/the-greatest-muhammad-ali-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>The biopic is the first authorized scripted series about the boxing champion, humanitarian, and global icon. </description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:00:06 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/the-greatest-muhammad-ali-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/600f467/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F1b%2Fca%2F0427af494822bb6d4176bd6cbc10%2Fthe-greatest-hero-amazon-news.png"/></item><item><title> Amazon’s Holiday Beauty Event is back for its sixth year—score up to 30% off across beauty categories</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-holiday-beauty-event-2026?utm_source=rss</link><description>Shop thousands of deals across everyday favorites and prestige brands like Armani, Dyson, Tarte, Clinique, and ELEMIS Skincare, along with a wide selection of exclusive gift sets and rotating 48-hour flash deals.</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:00:05 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-holiday-beauty-event-2026</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/7db1780/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F44%2Ff0%2F5c1c22304df691060a6025e50b33%2Fholiday-event-hero-amazon-news-10122026.jpg"/></item><item><title>How Amazon’s $100 million Right Now Climate Fund is protecting and restoring nature around the world</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/right-now-climate-fund?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest on how the fund is investing in nature-based climate projects across more than 15 countries.</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 08:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/right-now-climate-fund</guid><category>Sustainability</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/3b3e478/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F18%2F28%2F491e8860468392ba64fb1fbb34f4%2Frncf-hero-2000x1125-4.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon in the community: Here’s what’s happening in Seattle, Bellevue, and the Puget Sound</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the Puget Sound region.</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:58:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/fa71e99/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ff2%2Fe4%2F6f67188e480392ce0b19a6671b59%2Fspheres-rolling-blog-hero-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>How Amazon supported communities impacted by the Colombia earthquake</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/colombia-earthquake-amazon-disaster-relief?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon donated emergency supplies, rallied over 150 volunteers, and partnered with five organizations to support earthquake recovery.</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:28:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/colombia-earthquake-amazon-disaster-relief</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/a81f7ff/2147483647/strip/true/crop/900x900+350+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F4c%2F1f%2F6fdfb9b54f42919d50fdf8572663%2Fcolumbia-amazon-volunteer-disasterrelief-amazonnews-cdlt-10122026.png"/></item><item><title>Watch the teaser trailer for ‘Bloodaxe,’ the epic Viking drama coming to Prime Video January 20, 2027</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/bloodaxe-vikings-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>The highly anticipated new series, which has been renewed for Season 2, is helmed by Michael Hirst (creator of ‘Vikings’) and Horatio Hirst.</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 18:15:34 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/bloodaxe-vikings-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/ac86744/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fc8%2F08%2Ffc9a2e7c4f2cb7289a5df596b6cd%2Fbloodaxe-hero-amazon-news.png"/></item><item><title> &apos;Love Me Love Me 3,&apos; the next sequel in the hit romantic drama series, coming to Prime Video</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/love-me-love-me-3-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>The third film will continue the young adult saga based on Stefania S.&apos;s international best-selling novels.</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 13:56:06 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/love-me-love-me-3-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/3e3a7ae/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F38%2F7c%2Fe74a6c4b41b68813d8172e2e3906%2Flove-me-love-me-3-announce-hero-amazon-news.png"/></item></channel></rss>